Las Pegasus Municipal Co., Ltd.

[en.FOCUS_C07_LPLIG_CIVIL_desc]
The city goverment of Las Pegasus Economic Zone is currently running perfectly well. The consortium decided to establish an independent municipal company, just in case... in case of what? In case the government wants to do business with us, right?

[zh.FOCUS_C07_LPLIG_CIVIL]
洛马基市政有限公司

[zh.FOCUS_C07_LPLIG_CIVIL_desc]
洛马基经济特区的市政府目前运作非常良好。财团决定设立与政府独立的市政公司，仅仅是以防万一... 万一什么？万一政府想要和我们进行商业合作呢对吧？

